      "label": "Politician delivering a speech with overlaid text",
      "description": "Nancy Pelosi is depicted in a formal setting, likely a press conference or official address, with her right hand raised in a gesture while speaking. Overlaid text falsely attributes hateful and racist rhetoric to Democratic politicians, including Ilhan Omar, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, and Ayanna Pressley. The text claims they 'hate whites, jews, christians, conservatives, republicans,' which is a direct and false attack on these individuals and their political affiliation, invoking harmful stereotypes and targeting protected characteristics. This is a hateful meme designed to delegitimize and demonize specific political figures and their ideology through false and inflammatory claims, using the visual of Pelosi to imply she is the source or representative of this alleged hatred. The scene includes visual elements participating in the composition: Nancy Pelosi as the central figure, overlaid text, and background elements such as a U.S. flag and microphone.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_47aad064"
