      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ab849adc",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "hate",
      "label": "hateful emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is hate, conveyed through the overlaid text that falsely attributes hateful and racist rhetoric to Democratic politicians, including Ilhan Omar, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, and Ayanna Pressley. The text explicitly states 'we hate whites, jews, christians, conservatives, republicans,' which is a direct expression of hatred toward multiple protected groups and political ideologies. This emotion is central to the meme's intent to demonize and delegitimize these individuals and their party.",
